---
---

<section id="support">
  <h2>Support my work</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    If something I built has helped you, a small contribution keeps things going.
  </p>

  <article class="channel">
    <div class="channel-head">
      <h3>GitHub Sponsors</h3>
      <span class="audience">International</span>
    </div>
    <p>
      One-time or monthly sponsorship, processed through Open Source Collective.
      Goes directly to maintaining the extensions and tools listed above.
    </p>
    <a class="cta" href="https://github.com/sponsors/hueanmy">
      Sponsor on GitHub &rarr;
    </a>
  </article>

  <article class="channel">
    <div class="channel-head">
      <h3>MoMo</h3>
      <span class="audience">Việt Nam</span>
    </div>
    <p>Quét QR bằng app MoMo để gửi nhanh, không phí.</p>
    <details class="qr-reveal">
      <summary>Hiện MoMo QR</summary>
      <img src="/momo-qr.jpg" alt="MoMo QR code" class="qr" />
    </details>
  </article>

  <article class="channel">
    <div class="channel-head">
      <h3>Chuyển khoản ngân hàng (VietQR)</h3>
      <span class="audience">Việt Nam</span>
    </div>
    <p>Quét QR bằng app ngân hàng bất kỳ hỗ trợ VietQR.</p>
    <details class="qr-reveal">
      <summary>Hiện VietQR</summary>
      <img src="/vietqr.jpg" alt="VietQR code" class="qr" />
    </details>
  </article>

  <p class="thanks">Thank you &mdash; it really means a lot.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  .channel {
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .channel:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .channel-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .channel h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .audience {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .channel p {
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background 150ms ease;
  }

  .cta:hover {
    background: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.16);
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }

  .qr-reveal summary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    transition: background 150ms ease;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .qr-reveal summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .qr-reveal summary::after {
    content: '  ↓';
    font-size: 0.85em;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .qr-reveal[open] summary::after {
    content: '  ↑';
  }

  .qr-reveal summary:hover {
    background: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.16);
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }

  .qr {
    display: block;
    width: 220px;
    height: auto;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 8px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .thanks {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .channel-head {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
    .qr {
      width: 180px;
    }
  }
</style>
